  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/f401a0d3f7a08f3ea35f680d05787dc386828fa83f81aff99f02db6216186195.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tGọi vị trí người đứng ở trên tháp truyền hình là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math>, hai cột mốc ở dưới đất lần lượt là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>C</mi></semantics></math>, chân tháp truyền hình là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó các tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>62</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>54</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>43</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>352</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m.<br>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>62</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>62</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>D</mi></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>54</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>54</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Áp dụng định lí côsin cho tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>62</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>54</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>62</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>352</mn><mrow><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>54</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>⋅</mo><mo>cos</mo><msup><mn>43</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>264</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>027</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tSuy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>264</mn><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mn>027</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>514</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).<br>Vậy khoảng cách giữa hai cột mốc khoảng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>514</mn></semantics></math> m.",
